@startuml
title Create Product - sequence
actor User
participant UI as "UI/MyInventorySystem"
participant Manager as "InventoryManager"
participant ProdRepo as "IProductRepository"

User -> UI: Submit CreateProduct(productDto)
UI -> Manager: CreateProduct(productDto)
Manager -> ProdRepo: Add(Product)
ProdRepo --> Manager: Product (with Id)
Manager --> UI: createdProduct
UI --> User: confirmation/id

@enduml
